[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0010","text":"哦，在练走台步吗？\n走得非常漂亮哦。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0020","text":"是的……\n像画一条直线一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0030","text":"像被吊着脑袋一样……\n笔直地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0040","text":"…………！\n很好，雾子。能在那里转个身吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0050","text":"好、好的……！\n——啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0060","text":"哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0070","text":"没事吧？雾子。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0080","text":"对、对不起……\n让你扶了我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0090","text":"一说话……就会分心……\n然后就站不稳了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_01_0100","text":"哈哈……这样啊……！\n抱歉，突然叫你。"}]
